{"id":"588725","name":"芹菜拌香干","author":"香香的小厨房","authorId":"10121381","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/588725/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"野芹菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香干","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"芹菜焯水两分钟捞出。","img":"images/588725/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"过凉开水。","img":"images/588725/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香干也焯水捞出。","img":"images/588725/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"芹菜挤掉水份切碎。","img":"images/588725/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"豆腐干切丁。","img":"images/588725/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切好的芹菜和豆腐干放入盘中。","img":"images/588725/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"碗中放入蒜末、干辣椒段和白芝麻。","img":"images/588725/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入热油。","img":"images/588725/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放点生抽、白糖、蚝油、少许盐搅拌均匀。","img":"images/588725/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将酱汁倒入。","img":"images/588725/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀后淋入香油即可。","img":"images/588725/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}